OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway drivers face severe
OL,4,Adelays after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M6 in Cheshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed in both directions following a
OL,8,Fcrash, with severe delays reported.
OL,10,FTraffic England said there had been a
OL,11,Fcollision on the northbound section of
OL,12,Fthe motorway where it meets the M56 at
OL,13,Fthe Lymm Interchange, near Warrington.
OL,15,FIt said traffic had been diverted off
OL,16,Fthe M6 via the exit and entry slip
OL,17,Froads at junction 20 and there were
OL,18,Fhalf-hour delays, with about four miles
OL,19,F(6.4km) of congestion on the approach.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
