OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway drivers face severe
OL,4,Adelays after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic monitoring service Inrix said
OL,7,Fsouthbound traffic had built up to
OL,8,Fbefore junction 22 for Newton Le
OL,9,FWillows, while those heading northbound
OL,10,Fcould expect congestion from junction
OL,11,F19 for Knutsford.
